<title>ITALY: Safilo in eyewear deal with Max Mara.</title>
<headline>Safilo in eyewear deal with Max Mara.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian eyeglass maker Safilo said in a statement that it signed a deal with fashion house Max Mara to produce eyewear under the Max Mara name.</p>
<p>Safilo said Max Mara sunglasses and eyeglasses, to be manufactured by Safilo'as Carrera-Optyol division, would be on the market by September.</p>
<p>Maxa Mara has annual sales of 1.4 trillion lire and distributes its clothes through 660 shops in more than 80 countries.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
